cars.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":0,"text":"Brilli Peri is absent after a practice accident.","q":false},{"lap":0,"text":"Because of the dust from the dirt roads, the cars were started individually at intervals of one minute.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":0,"text":"The departures began at 9:30 AM Sunday with the start of the 1500 class, followed by the two liters, next those over 2 liters and finally the 1100 cc cars.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":0,"text":"Brilli Peri is absent after a practice accident.","q":false},{"lap":1,"text":"On the first lap Campari in the 1500 Alfa Romeo beat the previous record by three minutes","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":1,"text":"Bona has ignition trouble leaving the start and spends about half an hour repairing a broken wire.","q":false,"c":6},{"lap":1,"text":"On the first lap Campari in the 1500 Alfa Romeo beat the previous record by three minutes","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":1,"text":"Bona has ignition trouble leaving the start and spends about half an hour repairing a broken wire.","q":false,"c":6},{"lap":2,"text":"Campari improves the lap record by twelve seconds to 49m58.8s.","q":false,"c":15},{"lap":2,"text":"Materassi runs second, two minutes behind Campari.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":2,"text":"Campari improves the lap record by twelve seconds to 49m58.8s.","q":false,"c":15},{"lap":2,"text":"Materassi runs second, two minutes behind Campari.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":3,"text":"However, at the beginning of lap three between San Piero a Sieve and Scarperia, Campari was forced to retire with a broken supercharger bearing.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":3,"text":"He then took over the lead ahead of Presenti and Ferrari in Alfa Romeos.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":3,"text":"Meanwhile Ferrari and Presenti, had a tight duel for the second place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":3,"text":"Note that on the third lap the impetuous Luigi Fagioli was fourth with his tiny Salmson.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":5},{"lap":3,"text":"However, at the beginning of lap three between San Piero a Sieve and Scarperia, Campari was forced to retire with a broken supercharger bearing.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":3,"text":"He then took over the lead ahead of Presenti and Ferrari in Alfa Romeos.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":3,"text":"Meanwhile Ferrari and Presenti, had a tight duel for the second place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":3,"text":"Note that on the third lap the impetuous Luigi Fagioli was fourth with his tiny Salmson.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":5},{"lap":4,"text":"The best Bugatti was Beccaria's; he was sixth on lap four when he had to retire.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":14},{"lap":4,"text":"The best Bugatti was Beccaria's; he was sixth on lap four when he had to retire.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":14},{"lap":6,"text":"Saccomani goes off the road on the last lap and is slightly injured.","q":false,"c":13},{"lap":6,"text":"Materassi finished after 5h14m54s, followed 3m5s later by Presenti, who managed to keep his second place on the final lap from Ferrari who was only 15s behind.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":6,"text":"In fourth place was the young Marano, a new Maserati recruit.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":6,"text":"Fagioli finished sixth with his Salmson type S. Sebastian with supercharger.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":5},{"lap":6,"text":"Borzacchini in eighth position, ended with almost no brakes, after pausing several times.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7},{"lap":6,"text":"In all, 13 drivers finished from 29 starters.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":6,"text":"Saccomani goes off the road on the last lap and is slightly injured.","q":false,"c":13},{"lap":6,"text":"Materassi finished after 5h14m54s, followed 3m5s later by Presenti, who managed to keep his second place on the final lap from Ferrari who was only 15s behind.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":6,"text":"In fourth place was the young Marano, a new Maserati recruit.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":6,"text":"Fagioli finished sixth with his Salmson type S. Sebastian with supercharger.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":5},{"lap":6,"text":"Borzacchini in eighth position, ended with almost no brakes, after pausing several times.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7},{"lap":6,"text":"In all, 13 drivers finished from 29 starters.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"}]}